    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/a838f4884383967a1e26d37727aecf05.poster.avif?t=1755675539\" width=800 height=159 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/a838f4884383967a1e26d37727aecf05.webm?t=1755675539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Drone Arsenal</strong> \u2014 an exciting game about modern UAVs! Step onto the front line and eliminate terrorists. Capture bases and upgrade three drone branches to win this war!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose a drone:  </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/27dd624917b1427f09e5767df81c1303.poster.avif?t=1755675539\" width=800 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/27dd624917b1427f09e5767df81c1303.webm?t=1755675539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/27dd624917b1427f09e5767df81c1303.mp4?t=1755675539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Select payload:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/7d90a7ffd908b77081ae7e20f6ffcfee.poster.avif?t=1755675539\" width=800 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/7d90a7ffd908b77081ae7e20f6ffcfee.webm?t=1755675539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/7d90a7ffd908b77081ae7e20f6ffcfee.mp4?t=1755675539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade drones:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/a098e3ea531c28d74a3a184e9553f45b.poster.avif?t=1755675539\" width=800 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/a098e3ea531c28d74a3a184e9553f45b.webm?t=1755675539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/a098e3ea531c28d74a3a184e9553f45b.mp4?t=1755675539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>  </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Attack</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/c81cc8ad76a670f2901dd2a2068a12de.poster.avif?t=1755675539\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/c81cc8ad76a670f2901dd2a2068a12de.webm?t=1755675539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/c81cc8ad76a670f2901dd2a2068a12de.mp4?t=1755675539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evade EW and air defenses:  </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/477e55c5e16d5b048a4242ab626c92c5.poster.avif?t=1755675539\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/477e55c5e16d5b048a4242ab626c92c5.webm?t=1755675539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/477e55c5e16d5b048a4242ab626c92c5.mp4?t=1755675539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture bases and win!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three Drone Branches: The agile kamikaze is perfect for ramming, the heavy-lift striker excels at payload drops, and the stealthy scout is ideal for covert missions and calling in artillery!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modular Drone Upgrades: Customize each drone with new propellers, chassis, cameras, and antennas.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ Targets: Infantry, tanks, vehicles, artillery, air defense systems, watercraft, aircraft, ground structures, electronic warfare, and anti-air defenses.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart AI: Enemies actively resist\u2014soldiers aim accurately, and vehicles dodge attacks. The drone\u2019s camera is equipped with advanced AI for enemy scanning.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics: Drones react to payload weight\u2014upgrade lifting capacity but balance it with maneuverability!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible Camera: Switch between first- and third-person views for full combat control.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Missions: Deliver medkits, infiltrate HQs, and eliminate enemy leaders!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/033a4264b9a61475b17f400a57ace1f1.avif?t=1755675539\" width=1220 height=560 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/a838f4884383967a1e26d37727aecf05.poster.avif?t=1755675539\" width=800 height=159 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/a838f4884383967a1e26d37727aecf05.webm?t=1755675539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Drone Arsenal</strong> \u2014 an exciting game about modern UAVs! Step onto the front line and eliminate terrorists. Capture bases and upgrade three drone branches to win this war!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose a drone:  </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/27dd624917b1427f09e5767df81c1303.poster.avif?t=1755675539\" width=800 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/27dd624917b1427f09e5767df81c1303.webm?t=1755675539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/27dd624917b1427f09e5767df81c1303.mp4?t=1755675539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Select payload:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/7d90a7ffd908b77081ae7e20f6ffcfee.poster.avif?t=1755675539\" width=800 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/7d90a7ffd908b77081ae7e20f6ffcfee.webm?t=1755675539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/7d90a7ffd908b77081ae7e20f6ffcfee.mp4?t=1755675539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade drones:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/a098e3ea531c28d74a3a184e9553f45b.poster.avif?t=1755675539\" width=800 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/a098e3ea531c28d74a3a184e9553f45b.webm?t=1755675539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/a098e3ea531c28d74a3a184e9553f45b.mp4?t=1755675539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>  </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Attack</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/c81cc8ad76a670f2901dd2a2068a12de.poster.avif?t=1755675539\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/c81cc8ad76a670f2901dd2a2068a12de.webm?t=1755675539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/c81cc8ad76a670f2901dd2a2068a12de.mp4?t=1755675539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evade EW and air defenses:  </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/477e55c5e16d5b048a4242ab626c92c5.poster.avif?t=1755675539\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/477e55c5e16d5b048a4242ab626c92c5.webm?t=1755675539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/477e55c5e16d5b048a4242ab626c92c5.mp4?t=1755675539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture bases and win!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three Drone Branches: The agile kamikaze is perfect for ramming, the heavy-lift striker excels at payload drops, and the stealthy scout is ideal for covert missions and calling in artillery!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modular Drone Upgrades: Customize each drone with new propellers, chassis, cameras, and antennas.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ Targets: Infantry, tanks, vehicles, artillery, air defense systems, watercraft, aircraft, ground structures, electronic warfare, and anti-air defenses.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart AI: Enemies actively resist\u2014soldiers aim accurately, and vehicles dodge attacks. The drone\u2019s camera is equipped with advanced AI for enemy scanning.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics: Drones react to payload weight\u2014upgrade lifting capacity but balance it with maneuverability!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible Camera: Switch between first- and third-person views for full combat control.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Missions: Deliver medkits, infiltrate HQs, and eliminate enemy leaders!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687360/extras/033a4264b9a61475b17f400a57ace1f1.avif?t=1755675539\" width=1220 height=560 /></span></p>",
